; XSparkFlow - XAUUSD M30 CandleFlow with the PLAIN trail only
;
; A deliberately stripped baseline for the Strategy Tester. The stop follows the
; last finished candle and nothing else: no following behind the best price, no
; tightening as the trade matures, no protecting the entry, and no profit taken
; in steps along the way.
;
; The take-profit levels are written out as explicit zeros rather than left out.
; A .set file only applies the settings it lists, so an omitted level would keep
; whatever was already in the dialog - and the comparison this file exists for
; would then be measuring the ladder as well as the trail.
;
; Run this against xauusd-m30-candleflow.set over the same period. If the full
; configuration does not beat this one, the extra machinery is not earning its
; complexity and should be turned off rather than tuned.
;
; The floor stays on at 0.25. It is not part of the comparison: a trail with no
; floor can park the stop inside the spread, which measures the broker rather
; than the strategy.
;
; Nothing here is a profitability claim. Neither configuration has been tested.

InpFlowEnableTrading=false
InpFlowAutoTuneForSymbol=true
InpFlowMaxOpenTrades=1

InpFlowMinBodyATRMult=0.0

InpFlowBufferATRMult=0.10
InpFlowBufferRangePct=0.0
InpFlowBufferPoints=0.0
InpFlowMinStopATRMult=0.25
InpFlowMaxStopATRMult=0.0

InpFlowMinTrailATRMult=0.25
InpFlowTrailATRMult=0.0
InpFlowTrailTightATRMult=0.0
InpFlowTrailTightenStartR=0.0
InpFlowTrailTightenFullR=0.0
InpFlowBreakevenAtR=0.0
InpFlowBreakevenOffsetR=0.0

InpFlowTP1AtR=0.0
InpFlowTP1ClosePct=0.0
InpFlowTP2AtR=0.0
InpFlowTP2ClosePct=0.0
InpFlowTP3AtR=0.0
InpFlowTP3ClosePct=0.0
InpFlowFinalTargetR=0.0

InpFlowRiskPct=1.0
InpFlowMaxRiskPct=3.5
InpFlowMaxAccountRiskPct=6.0
InpFlowMaxDailyDDPct=15.0
InpFlowUseTotalDDKillSwitch=true
InpFlowMaxTotalDDPct=25.0

InpFlowUseWeekendClose=true
InpFlowWeekendCloseHour=20
InpFlowWeekendCloseMinute=0

InpFlowVerboseLog=false

InpFlowUseVolatilityGate=false

InpFlowQuietMarketPct=60.0
InpFlowWildMarketPct=600.0
InpFlowEntrySlipPct=25.0
InpFlowExitSlipPct=85.0
InpFlowSpreadCapPct=40.0
InpFlowMaxSpreadATRPct=10.0

InpFlowUseSpreadFilter=true
InpFlowUseStopLevelValidation=true
InpFlowUseMarginCheck=true
InpFlowMarginBufferPct=20.0
InpFlowMaxQuoteAgeSeconds=15

InpFlowMagicNumber=770332
InpFlowOrderComment=CandleFlow_v1
InpFlowClearKillswitchLatch=false
